window.products.push({"id":441022,"name":"Lubsmuns Candle Wick Trimmer,Stainless Steel Wick Trimmer,Wick Cutter Candle Scissors Allow Cleaner Burn Wick and Prevent Soot Buildup,Candle Accessor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JIC1qCGML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This candle wick trimmer is made of high-quality stainless steel, durable and not easy to rust. Any wick can be trimmed effortlessly according to your wishes, and precise cutting can ensure cleaner and more fully burned candles. This matte black candle cutter is a great gift for candle lovers. The Wick Cutter for Candles Attributes: The Candle Wick Trimmer Size:Length 6.89in/17.5cm, Width 2.36in/6cm The Candle Wick Trimmer Material:Stainless Steel The Wick Cutter For Candles Color: Matte Black Package Include: 1 x Matte Black Candle Wick Trimmer The Wick Cutter For Candles Use Warm Tips: 1.The new candle can be lighted for a few minutes and then extinguished and trimmed after the wick sticks to the oil. 2.When the candle is just extinguished, the candle wick should be trimmed in a soft and oily state 3.Use the first half of the wick trimmer to trim the wax wick 4. Extinguish the candle every 2-3 hours, and use candle scissors to extinguish the candle wick,it is advisable to trim to 0.5- -0.8cm 5.The candle wick that has been cooled and carbonized and hardened must not be trimmed to avoid breaking the root of the wick,impact ignites again 6.After use,the position where the wick cutter for candles’s head touches the candle will occupy the candle oil, just wipe it with a paper towel or a rag. key words:candle wick trimmer gold,candle wick trimmer black,candle wick trimmer rose gold,candle wick trimmer bronze,wick trimmer bulk,wick trimmer gold,wick trimmer for candle making,wick trimmer black,wick cutter for candles","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JIC1qCGML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lubsmuns","source_asin":"B08TGJTBVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TGJTBVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TGJTBVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
