window.products.push({"id":441235,"name":"Corner Floating Wine Glass for Beach Set, Pool, Picnic, Wine, Beer, Cocktail 13.5oz (Pink & Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y8dE4FNXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Corner Floating Wine Glass gives you the unique opportunity to enjoy life's greatest pleasures of drinking wine with friends, family, and significant others whether at the pool, beach, snow, park, or anywhere else. Dishwasher safe and long-lasting, this wine glass will look beautiful in your collection and will be your go-to when bringing beverages to any outdoor party or activity! With our innovative design, you can now allow your wine glass to calmly float in the water or stick in to the sand worry free of breaking glass. This creative wine glass is the sure thing to rock your next party. It makes an amazing gift for just about any wine enthusiast, beach bum, or pool regular. -ELEGANT AND USEFUL - This beautiful, elegant pink wine glass can be staked into sand, grass, dirt, snow, and float on water for the perfect outdoor party accessory! -VERSATILE DESIGN - Sturdy stakes allow the wine glass to float in water and stick in to the ground to reduce spillage when you're out at the beach, the park or the backyard. The stem of the wine glass measures 6.25\" and is long enough to allow for a sturdy hold in the snow or sand. Diamond shape mid-way through the stem lets you know how far to stick the wine glass into the sand or snow so there is no second guessing! -PREMIUM QUALITY - Made of BPA free acrylic; each Beach Glass holds 13.5 oz. This is more than enough to hold a small (4 oz) or a large (8 oz) glass of wine. Safe to drink from and extremely durable. Kid friendly if they would like to join the adults with a glass of soda or grape juice. -DISHWASHER SAFE - Extremely durable; the perfect alternative to disposable plastic cups or breakable glasses. Drinking with your friends outdoors has never been easier!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y8dE4FNXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Corner Goods","source_asin":"B07X49VTV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X49VTV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X49VTV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
