window.products.push({"id":441291,"name":"HYPERTAI Black Wallpaper, 12 Inch x 78.7 Inch Self Adhesive Peel and Stick Wall Paper Removable Kitchen Wallpaper Vinyl Black Wallpaper Cabinet Furnit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Av9FvlSoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Black Wallpaper - It can effectively reduce the generation of bubbles. The solid color gives the room a more advanced texture. Our backing paper is designed with a measure and cut grid which makes our black wallpaper easy to cut and apply to any size bedroom wall. Removable - It can easily remove. The wallpaper can easily remove because it is peel and stick. It will not damage your wall and also very tolerant of tenants. Easy to Clean - The black wallpaper surface uses a PVC lamination film process, so it can effectively block the adhesion of stains, Wipe with a wet towel when cleaning. MULTIPLE USE - Black wallpaper can be applied to the objects with smooth surface, such as kitchen counter, furniture, notebook, dresser drawer, crafts, bedside table, bookcase, door even wall, can meet your different DIY needs. It's the best choice for you to decorate your home in an affordable way! Warm Tips - Black contact paper is not suitable for uneven or dusty surfaces. Do not put black wallpaper in hot places. If air bubbles are created after installation, you can use a sharp object to pierce the bubbles, which will give your wall a better appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Av9FvlSoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HYPERTAI","source_asin":"B0C687HVB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C687HVB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C687HVB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
