window.products.push({"id":441341,"name":"Zwilling J.A. Henckels Twin Cuisine 5-1/2-Inch Hollow-Edge Santoku","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21XZP1BESQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Twin Cuisine is the latest addition to the J.A. Henckels family of fine cutlery. This 5-1/2-inch hollow-edge santoku is one-piece precision forged, with excellent cutting retention, corrosion resistance, and an exclusive ergonomic handle design. This Asi Amazon.com One of the newest premium lines from Zwilling J.A. Henckels, Twin Cuisine was introduced in 2004 with a major revelation: it's the first high-quality forged cutlery line to feature a molded handle with a visible, full-length tang that runs horizontally. In fact, the handle is absolutely stunning, with the shiny tang curving slightly as it courses through the black nonslip polypropylene. With no rivets or gaps, the ergonomic handle provides seamless comfort, while the full tang adds weight for precision balance. The forged, single-piece blade, made from high-carbon, no-stain steel and strengthened in Henckels's Friodur exclusive Friodur ice-hardening process, retains its sharp edge through extensive cutting and chopping. Made in Germany and covered by a lifetime warranty, Twin Cuisine knives are dishwasher-safe but are best cared for when washed and dried by hand. Thanks to the rising popularity of sushi and other Asian delicacies, Asian-style knives are now commonly found in American kitchens. A medium-size Asian chef's knife from the Twin Cuisine collection, the 5-1/2-inch santoku features a straight spine that curves downward to a fairly flat edge that excels at a multitude of chopping, slicing, and dicing food preparation tasks. Hollowed-out ovals along the razor-sharp edge reduce friction during cutting, resulting in paper-thin slices of fish, meat, or vegetables. A versatile addition to any kitchen, the santoku makes a superb gift for the chef who especially enjoys preparing Asian cuisine. --Ann Bieri From the Manufacturer Twin Cuisine is the first quality forged knife to combine the comfort of a truly ergonomic, molded handle with the precision weight and balance of a full horizontal tang. Plus, the Twin Cuisines exclusive, award-winning patented handle design is a new standard in fine cutlery (U.S. design patent #D524,121). The series is available in a variety of styles for a variety of cutting tasks. Twin Cuisine is also available in a variety of block sets and gift sets. The Twin Cuisine series truly is a masterful blend of form and function. A Higher Standard in Knife Construction Twin Cuisine knives are traditionally forged from a single piece of J.A. Henckelss exclusive high-carbon, no-stain steel formula. The result is a knife with high durability, professional strength, and weight. Twin Cuisine also uses J.A. Henckelss Friodur ice-hardening process, which results in a blade that has excellent cutting-edge retention and corrosion resistance. The blade edge is precision honed and laser controlled to maintain a sharper and consistent blade angle. New Ergonomic Handle Technology The Twin Cuisine handle features exclusive new and innovative handle technology: a full horizontal tang without rivets. High-impact polypropylene is bonded with J.A. Henckelss high-carbon, no-stain steel, resulting in a remarkably comfortable handle with a smooth shape and no gaps. The world-famous Zwilling J.A. Henckels logo is etched on the end of every Twin Cuisine knife handle. indicating its quality. Features Traditional one-piece hot drop-forged construction: Provides high durability, strength, and weight. Traditional one-piece hot drop-forged construction: Provides high durability, strength, and weight. Laser-controlled edge: Is sharper and stays sharper longer. Has a more consistent blade angle. Laser-controlled edge: Is sharper and stays sharper longer. Has a more consistent blade angle. Friodur ice hardening: Maximum no-stain properties and more blade strength. Improved resistance to corrosion and pitting. Friodur ice hardening: Maximum no-stain properties and more blade strength. Improved resistance to corrosion and pitting. Super bolster: Provides weight, insures safety, and adds balance. Super bolster: Provides weight, insures safety, and adds balance. New, patented full horizontal handle tang without rivets: Provides a strong, smooth, comfortable handle with great control and balance design. New, patented full horizontal handle tang without rivets: Provides a strong, smooth, comfortable handle with great control and balance design. High-carbon, no-stain steel, an exclusive J.A. Henckels formula: Nonstaining, nonrusting. High-carbon, no-stain steel, an exclusive J.A. Henckels formula: Nonstaining, nonrusting. Precision-honed blade: Is sharper and stays sharper longer. Precision-honed blade: Is sharper and stays sharper longer. Dishwasher-safe: Easy care (although hand washing is recommended by J.A. Henckels). Dishwasher-safe: Easy care (although hand washing is recommended by J.A. Henckels). Full warranty: J.A. Henckels stands behind all its knives. Full warranty: J.A. Henckels stands behind all its knives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21XZP1BESQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENCKELS","source_asin":"B0006ZSXLM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006ZSXLM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006ZSXLM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":441342,"name":"Indusleaf Pink Mandala Tapestry Wall Decor for Bedroom Women Hanging Bohemian Living Room Girls Boho Medallion Gary Marble","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zl0oAuF2S._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"FANTASTIC MANDALA TAPESTRY - Mandala is a powerful spiritual symbol that is mostly used in ceremonial rituals, in worship, in sacred art, and in meditation. Mandala have been used throughout the centuries and across many spiritual practices as tools and symbols representing the soul and our place in the Universe A SPECIAL GIFTS IDEA FOR YOU - Everyone looks forward to opening gifts with bright eyes and huge smile on their faces. This eye-catching mandala tapestry must be your perfect choice! Mixed with gray marble textural design, which can effortlessly revitalize any room wall MULTIFUNCTION PSYCHEDELIC TAPESTRY - Your choice of wall art hanging is a great way to express your personal taste. This pink mandala tapestry can be used as your bedroom, living room, dinning room, bathroom’s wall hanging decor. While it can also be used as tablecloth, picnic cloth, beach towel, as long as you can imagine, it can use in various places SOFT MATERIAL & SUITABLE SIZE - Every piece of the tapestry wall hanging we sell is made with one goal in mind: to help our customers express their personal style at home. So our team definitely choose the soft material and friendly natural dyes. We these medallion tapestries have two size for choosing: S (51inch*59inch); M (59inch*79inch) BUY AND YOU’LL HAVE OUR WORDS - We stand behind all our products and offer full customer support! Our wall decor are backed by 24-month money-back. If there are any dissatisfaction, you can get full refund without any reason. If you need a quality product and a company that will strive to make sure you are happy with your order - look no further!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zl0oAuF2S._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Indusleaf","source_asin":"B07VNC4BGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VNC4BGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VNC4BGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":441343,"name":"JMEXSUSS 100 LED Battery Operated Rope Lights Outdoor IP 65 Waterproof 8 Mode 33ft PVC Tube Blue Battery Christmas Fairy String Lights with Remote for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e5POB012L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Portable Rope Lights】 - The battery rope lights is powered by 3 AA batteries (excluded), no need socket, so it is portable and can be installed anywhere for decoration and atmosphere creating. Battery powered rope lights are also safer than plug in string lights, which can be bent into any shapes to decorate your camping tent, cornhole board, pool, golf car, etc. and you don't have to worry about the rope fairy lights knot, it can recycle for next creative decorations. 【More Fun with Smart Remote 】 - The battery operated rope lights can set working mode ,timer and adjust the brightness at any time by the remote . Press the TIMER button to set the rope light to automatically turn on for 6 hours and turn off for 18 hours every day. Let's click the remote in your hand to add more fun to you and your family's life. 【8 Lighting Mode】- 8 Modes(combination, in wave, sequential, slo glo, chasing/flash, slow fade, twinkle/flash, and steady on). You could use different modes of the blue rope lights according to different occasions. For example, you could use the flashing mode during the party, or, you could use the steady on mode with a relaxing vacation. Battery operated blue lights make your life more colorful. 【Durable for Indoor Outdoor Use】- The battery rope lights outdoor waterproof are covered with clear PVC tubes to protect the fragile copper wire fairy lights, it is more durable than other ordinary string lights. IP 67 waterproof rope lights can be used for indoor and outdoor decoration. It is an ideal decoration for tree, fences, pool, yards, garden, terraces, bars, weddings, hotels, streets, commercial buildings, shopping centers, trampoline, yacht, car, camping tent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e5POB012L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JMEXSUSS","source_asin":"B09YT2ZJ9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YT2ZJ9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YT2ZJ9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
