window.products.push({"id":441356,"name":"Bath Bed Decor Set of 2 Throw Pillow Case Soft Decorative Square Cushion Cover for Couch 100% Cotton Square Euro Pillow Shams With Invisible Zipper Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VrowxGMgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand : Bath Bed Decor Box Contains : 2 Piece Cushion Cover / Shell only. Cushions are not included. Carefully hand finished with a fantabulous quality Cushion Cover will add a great accent to your living room, lounge or bedroom. PRODUCT FEATURES 1. Each Throw Pillow Cover is made of 100% cotton canvas for increased sturdiness 2. Each Cushion Cover has a high quality hidden/concealed zipper, that allows for easy insertion and removal of pillow inserts  3. Pillow Covers edges are stitched with overlock stitches to avoid fray and increase the strength of cushion covers 4. These throw pillow cases are suitable for use in sofa/couch & beds 5. Fully machine washable, we recommend following the care instructions provided on the Wash Care label GOOD TO KNOW BEFORE YOU BUY 1. Due to differences in color variances settings between each Computer, Laptop, Phone or Tablet the actual product might have a minor color difference to the picture on screen. 2. As each product is completely handmade, there may be minor size variation ( + or - 0.5 cm ) CHOOSING THE RIGHT PILLOW COVERS (OR) PILLOWS 1. Measure 2 adjacent sides of existing cushions. This will give the size of the pillow cover to choose. E.g. if the pillow is 18 x 18 Inch on the sides, then the pillow cover to choose is 18 x 18 Inch. 2. If buying new pillows, then a) Choose either the same size pillows as the pillow covers (e.g., 18x18 Inch Cover = 18x18 Inch Pillow) (OR) b) Choose up to a maximum of 2 inches bigger pillows than the pillow covers to get a full and fluffy pillow.(e.g., 18x18 Inch Cover = Up to 20x20 Inch Pillow) About Bath Bed Decor We are zealous about providing the finest quality products at a reasonable price for every home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VrowxGMgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MiToo","source_asin":"B0756DLJZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0756DLJZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0756DLJZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":441357,"name":"Twin Extra Long Silk Satin Fitted Sheet, Soft Deep Pocket Single Bottom Bed Sheets Sold Separately, Wrinkle Free, Non- Fading, Breathable, Fully Elast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710UIt6zY3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect for your next sleepover! A fitted twin xl single sheet is a great way to have a comfortable sleep. The hotel quality fitted sheet is soft and silky. It protects skin and hair. It is durable, breathable, and it keeps cool in both seasons. The breathable fabric allows you to rest peacefully at night. You'll never have to worry about whether the fitted sheet is staying in place throughout the night with the tear-resistant fabric. The fabric is fully smooth, which will feel great on your skin. A satin fitted sheet's soft, low-maintenance fabric is perfect for any bed! The fitted sheets will make your life easier because it is wrinkle-free. The breathable satin will help you stay dry and comfortable, even in the hottest summers. It can protect you and your bedcovers from spills and stains and also help you to avoid the hassle and expense of dry cleaning. It's also easy to clean and can be washed and dried in a clothes dryer. What makes us unique! Before packaging, every piece of this deep pocket mattress cover is properly tested and inspected to ensure it's is in perfect working order. We don't compromise on quality and offer the highest quality product at market-leading rates. Size and dimensions: Twin Satin Fitted Sheet Only: 39\"x75\"+12\"; Twin XL Satin Fitted Sheet Only: 39\"x80\"+12\"; Full Satin Fitted Sheet Only: 54\"x75\"+14\"; Queen Satin Fitted Sheet Only: 60\"x80\"+14\"; King Satin Fitted Sheet Only: 78\"x80\"+14\"; California King Fitted Sheet Only: 72\"x84\"+14\".  Replace your old and worn-out sheets with our Single Silk Bottom Bed Sheet. It provides a high level of softness and breathability and is much comfortable than cotton. Plus, you'll be able to enjoy a good night's rest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710UIt6zY3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lanest Housing","source_asin":"B09CKZGQ4F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CKZGQ4F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CKZGQ4F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":441358,"name":"VHC Brands Farmhouse Kitchen Window Curtains-Sawyer Mill Tan Tier Pair, 24x36, Charcoal Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OWnfpjjDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton FARMHOUSE TIER SET: Includes two 24 by 36 inch tier curtains with a 3.25 inch rod pocket for easy installation. Tier or cafe curtains are a great way to add privacy while still allowing unfiltered sunlight to come through from above. LIGHT FILTERING: Lined to provide additional privacy while filtering out harsh outside light. RUSTIC FARMHOUSE FLAIR: Versatile styling sure to match country chic, farmhouse, or cottage decor. EASY CARE: Machine wash on gentle and tumble dry on low. Iron safe. Includes rod pocket for easy hanging. CLASSIC PLAID: Charcoal black and dark tan plaid in a textured weave made of 100% cotton for easy care and superior durability. COORDINATING ACCESSORIES: The Sawyer Mill collection is relaxed and casual with mixed fabrics and patterns in neutral colors great for modern farmhouse or cottage-style decor. The collection features coordinated bedding, window treatments, rugs and more to provide everything you need to make your country farmhouse dreams a reality. AUTHENTICITY: Sometimes copied, never duplicated. VHC products ALWAYS feature attached product tags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OWnfpjjDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VHC Brands","source_asin":"B08899K6H6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08899K6H6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08899K6H6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":441359,"name":"5% Nutrition Rich Piana Gym Protein Shaker Bottle | Fits Most Cup Holders | Leak-Proof | Measurement Line | BPA-Free Plastic | Internal Mixer 20oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tLzDc2u3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BPA-FREE PROTEIN SHAKER BOTTLE with Interal Mixer STORE, MIX & POUR all from the same convenient shaker cup! MIX BCAAs, PROTEIN, and other supplements quickly and easily after your gym session. For cold drinks, also try our vacuum-insulated Ice Shaker from 5% Nutrition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tLzDc2u3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5% Nutrition","source_asin":"B0C1J9MF5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1J9MF5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1J9MF5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":441360,"name":"Black & Decker ODC425 Spacemaker 10-Cup Thermal Carafe Coffeemaker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GYGP2S97L.jpg","description":"Product Description Set the timer of the Coffee Spacemaker II by Black & Decker and let the smell of freshly brewed coffee wake you in the morning. Can't wait for that first cup? The Sneak-A-Cup feature lets you interrupt brewing while you fill your a cup. Once brewed, the 45-oz. stainless steel carafe keeps the coffee hot and fresh for hours. Other features include removable brew basket, removable water reservoir and under-cabinet mounting option. 10-cup capacity. Imported. 12Hx10-1/4Wx11D\". Amazon.com Black & Decker, long known as a maker of quality tools, brings that same dependability to the kitchen in its line of countertop appliances, such as the ODC425 10-cup Spacemaker thermal carafe coffeemaker. Constructed of sturdy white plastic with stainless steel carafe and accents, the Spacemaker gets its name from its horizontal design and under-cabinet mounting ability. The accompanying mounting hardware includes spacers of various widths to accommodate different styles of cabinet, whether the doors are flush or overhanging. This feature is great for small kitchens or kitchens with little available counter space; in addition, it's very useful for RVs, camping trailers, or pleasure-boat galleys, where it helps to have counter appliances bolted down. In addition to its space-saving feature, the Black & Decker ODC425 also sports a few other handy features. A stainless steel, thermal carafe keeps coffee hot for up to four hours; it has a white plastic handle and brew-through lid which locks to become airtight. There's programmable timer and clock for setting up an automatic brew time, with a display and five-button control panel on the front of the coffeemaker. And there are two features that allow caffeine cravers to have their first cup of coffee before the brewing's done. Sneak-A-Cup interrupts brewing while a cup is poured; Tap-A-Cup, an actual tap built into the bottom of the carafe handle, draws off a cup without interrupting the brew cycle at all. The removable brew basket is dishwasher safe (top rack). Hand wash carafe in hot water with a soft sponge and mild detergent; do not use abrasive cleansers or scrubbers on carafe. Rinse the brew basket and carafe thoroughly to ensure purity of coffee flavor. Wipe down the coffeemaker with a warm, damp cloth and dry completely; coffeemaker is not immersible. The carafe measures 10 by 7 by 6-1/2 inches and has a 10-cup (50-fluid-ounce) capacity. (An 10-cup coffeemaker produces 10 5-ounce cups.) The coffeemaker measures 11 by 14 by 12 inches. The Black & Decker ODC425 uses large flat-bottom paper coffee filters (not included). Black & Decker includes mounting hardware, a detailed instruction sheet, and a one-year limited warranty against materials or workmanship. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GYGP2S97L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLACK+DECKER","source_asin":"B0001LB9S0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001LB9S0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001LB9S0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
