window.products.push({"id":441457,"name":"Blackstone 5097 Silicone Spatula Mat for Laddle, Serving Spoon Drip Pad & Grill Utensil Holder for Kitchen, Stovetop, Cooking & Countertop-Heat Resist","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417RWlVa3zL._AC_.jpg","description":"Don't let the juices, sauces and drips ruin your countertop and grilling station Blackstone spatula rest makes after-cooking clean up a breeze. It holds drippy and saucy kitchen utensils and prevents them from creating a mess on the countertop, while also adding a pop of color to the worktop. Use this serving spoon rest in your next Epicurean adventure and see how this little accessory makes a real difference. The ladle rest is especially useful for grillers who can't find a proper and clean place to keep their tongs and spatulas while cooking outdoors. Functional features: • Built to last: Thick and durable construction ensures that the ladle holder rest can sustain every day, heavy-duty use in the kitchen. A great alternative to ceramic and spatula mat that break easily and rust after a few washes • Stable: Won't rock or wobble like those spoon-shaped holders • Effective: The grill utensil rest features a lip around the edges which is deep enough to prevent spillage so you can focus on cooking instead of cooling • Great size: Not too bulky, nor too small, this kitchen spatula rest is perfectly wide enough to hold small spoons as well as a huge serving spoon. Won't take too much of your space • Multifunctional: Can be used in kitchen, buffet tables, coffee stations and during camping. Premium quality silicone construction: • Non-toxic, chemical-free and safe for use in the kitchen • Does not absorb flavors or odors, so you can use the rest while you make gravy for chicken, wash it and use it again while you chocolate cake • Unlike plastic, silicone is heat resistant, so you can use it for holding hot spatula and also leave it on the countertop while you cook Great gift: Give the home chefs in your list a gift they will appreciate every time they look at the squeaky clean countertop. Our silicone spatula rest also makes a functional and useful housewarming gift for someone who has just moved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417RWlVa3zL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLACKSTONE","source_asin":"B096XWRY5Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096XWRY5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096XWRY5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
