window.products.push({"id":441599,"name":"SleepBetter Ambient Comfort Queen Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TVYX-egFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This queen-sized bed pillow is designed with cutting-edge nanotechnology that works with the body to increase oxygen levels in the blood, build strength, increase energy and accelerate muscle recovery. Made from 50 percent Holofiber and 50 percent super slick fiber, the pillow comes with a luxuriously soft 400-thread-count cotton sateen cover with a 2-inch gusset. The cover is corded and double-needle stitched, and can easily be removed to clean in the washer and dryer. How does it work? Ambient products feature a textile called Holofiber. Millions of microscopic lenses are introduced permanently into the fabric. Holofiber works with the body's own energy, modifying the spectrum of light and recycling energy back into the body. It is a new kind of recycling, harnessing the power of materials found abundantly in nature. Completely safe and permanent, Holofiber stays responsive and powerful for the life of the product. A simpler explanation is that the active ingredients in Holofiber, found abundantly in nature, react with the light to radiate certain wavelengths. When these fibers are placed in a pillow or mattress pad on a bed, the wavelengths penetrate any fabric (like sheets or pajamas), stimulating blood cells to increase oxygenation. This has been clinically proven. Why is oxygenation important? Increased oxygen in the blood improves circulation, physical performance and recovery time. Athletes recover faster from exercise with fewer aches and pains. Wounds heal faster due to better blood flow to the area. Circulation improves in hands and feet. Wake refreshed and energized after sleep. Experience a boost in energy levels. It works while one sleeps. Using an Ambient mattress pad or pillow on the bed has been shown to start the process, working immediately. One can experience the maximum effect after only 30 minutes, and it can last up to 15 hours. Sheets, blankets and pajamas will not block the wavelengths, and the special properties of Holofiber will never wash out. Available sizes are standard, queen, king, and body pillow size.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TVYX-egFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SleepBetter","source_asin":"B000HDPZSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HDPZSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HDPZSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
