window.products.push({"id":441724,"name":"COLZER 180 Pints up to 7,000 Sq. Ft Commercial Dehumidifier Includes Pump & Drain Hose, Powerful Compressor Fast Draw Air for Water Damage, Ideal for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G9HnlxVzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【180 PINTS COMMERCIAL DEHUMIDIFIER】: This industrial dehumidifier with a large capacity of 180PPD and 324 CFM airflow volume is ideal for fast drying water damage areas up to 7,000 sq ft at saturation (95°F, 90%) (90 PPD @ AHAM), powerful moisture removal is perfect for basements, building and construction sites, water damage following a flood or leak areas, to safeguard the health of you and your employees. 【HEAVY-DUTY BUILT-IN CONDENSATE PUMP】: Our dehumidifiers are equipped with an internal heavy-duty and robust condensate pump of 16 ft drain height connecting with a 10 ft wrinkle-free long drain hose (included), which allows our solid condensate pump to drain more efficiently, thus making it highly reliable to improve the air quality and protect your health. 【SMART LCD DISPLAY PANAL & FUNCTION】: This dehumidifier comes with a large LCD digital display which is on the top of the body, doesn't need to bend down for operation, simply just plug it in and turn it on, press up/down button to select your desired value. It also can display the humidity level and the job hours like the humidistat for better management of job site progress. Auto-restart and auto HGV defrost features make your life more convenient and energy-saving. 【HIGH MANEUVERABLE & STORED】: Equipped with the large semi-pneumatic wheels and rigid handle make the transportation of the large dehumidifier easier, even from downstairs to upstairs, you can move it around with ease, also can work for temporary use. The long PVC drain hose and power cord, adding ultimate flexibility for installation, can be wrapped on the winders on the back, a cost- and energy-efficient way to shield your space from the damaging effects of moisture. 【REMARKABLE DURABILITY & 5 YEARS WARRANTY】: Our dehumidifiers are built to last with roto-molded housing is much better at resisting dents, abrasion, and corrosion than metal housing, strong & solid material are making it an ideal choice to prevent from any impact damage. This ETL-listed water damage dehumidifier is also backed with a 5 years warranty after-sales service, customer support team will always stand by for any help at any time, any questions please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G9HnlxVzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLZER","source_asin":"B08TRDWGSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TRDWGSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TRDWGSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
