window.products.push({"id":441895,"name":"Camping Accessories Kit, Collapsible Cutting Board,Chef Fruit Knife Set,Shears with Magnet Holder,2 Pack Aprons Black and White with 2 Pockets,Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+GZtArt-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ALL-IN-ONE CAMPING PREP UTENSILS IT]:This camp kitchen prep kit come with a collapsible cutting board, cuttlery tray, a chef and fruit knives set with sheaths, a magnetic fridge scissors, 2 aprons black and crean.Overall,totally 10 pcs combined,if you divide up the cost per piece by10 it’s only a few bucks each,it's really a bargain deal for your own use and gift for your family or friends. [CAMPING CUTTING BOARD]: The pretty handy wash basin folds easily to save space and comes with a cutlery box for you to store your folks and knifes. You can used it for everything, from washing veges, dishes and meats as a strainer and marinating certain meats or to carry accessories. As a draining colander bowl and sink, the stopper sealed very well without water leak out.When you slice meats or fruis without juices running everywhere.Also the feet are sturdy and nonskid. [CHEF KNIFE AND FRUIT KNIFE]: The chef knife and fruit knife are pretty sharp and easy clean. You can use chef knife to slice meat effortlessly. The blades are made of food standard stainess steel and coated by black color is resistant to rust and stains. Come with sheaths to protect the kitchen knives safe and convenience to pack them into drawer. [KITCHEN SHEARS]:The scissors are very sturdy, well made, and extremely sharp.The cutting power is pretty good to cut off fish fins and small tendons, bones and cartilage. The shear have a magnet holder to hold it so you can put it on your frig.You will really like being able to separate for cleaning .You also must love all the extras: nutcracker, bottle opener, can and soda tab lifter, fruit & vegetables peeler, flat screwdriver and micro-serrated edge. [WATER RESISTANT APRONS]:The aprons is water and oil resistant and the stains and mess clean up really well each time. The pinny comes with two pockets you can carry your phone and cook book around so you can have music when cooking. With the ajustable straps you can trim the size to match you well, no matter what is your stature. Two color avaible one black and one cream for both man and woman.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+GZtArt-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAKUPYOU","source_asin":"B0BLVMDSPM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-441895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLVMDSPM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLVMDSPM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
